          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വളയുക (vaḷayuka) is native Dravidian: DEDR 5313 lists Malayalam vaḷayuka, \"to surround\", with വള, \"a ring, a bangle\": to make a ring round something."
